  "compatibility": "Compatible SwiftPM ranges, not an application lockfile. The 44 packages released in upstream-parity-20261116, including swift-ai-core 1.6.0, raise their umbrella minimums so the umbrella ships the parity fixes; ByteDance, LMNT and Vercel gain explicit 1.1.0 minimums. The compatibility facade forwards maxImagesPerCall and other APIs added in core 1.6.0, and its provider factories now forward to native package behavior. Vertex Gemini provider metadata moves from the google key to googleVertex/vertex, matching upstream. Existing public selectors are unchanged.",
  "recordedAfterPublication": true,
