  "verificationScope": "Forty-four independent minor releases passed standalone CI and remote tag/Release readback; 62 clean modular public-tag clients and actual 3.6.0 / preserved 2.8.1 umbrella clients passed without mirrors or local overrides. The root compatibility suite (1755 tests) passed against the public tags. Hosted canonical CI with the Swift test job passed for the implementation source and for this exact tag source. The dedicated M3 runner verification was not repeated for this release. This append-only record follows the tag to avoid self-reference. Paid/live calls were not run.",
